Sure, you can just put:

function(x) {
 q1 = quantile(x)[2]
 q3 = quantile(x)[4]
 iqr = q3 -q1
 upper = q3+1.5*iqr
 lower = q1-1.5*iqr

 ##Trim upper and lower

 up = max(x[x < upper])
 lo = min(x[x > lower])

 return(c(lo, up))
}

in the box instead of get_tails.

Best,
Ian

